&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Your personal data will be retained by Baringa for up to two years, in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/globalassets/careers/dp-007-nerpn-amer--apac-recruitment-privacy-notice-word.pdf&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Notice (AMER &amp;amp; APAC)&lt;/a&gt;, to assess your application and meet applicable reporting and legal obligations. In line with the Australian Privacy Act and Singapore’s Personal Data Protection Act (PDPA), you may have rights to access, correct, or request limited deletion of your personal data. For more information, please contact us at &lt;a ----------<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;About Baringa&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Baringa is a global consulting firm that partners with leaders to drive change and create value. With deep industry expertise, and enabled by advanced technology, the firm helps clients to deliver with greater confidence and certainty. With over 2,000 people across the UK, Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, the firm combines global insight with local understanding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The firm works across energy and resources, financial services, government and public sector, consumer products and retail, pharmaceuticals and life sciences, manufacturing, and technology, media and telecoms, with capabilities spanning strategy, transformation and operational excellence – all powered by advanced technology, data, AI and digital innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clients value Baringa’s collaborative approach and the way its teams integrate seamlessly – all working with a shared understanding of what matters most. The firm is known for its kind, curious experts who listen closely and care deeply about client success as they help clients transform energy markets, modernise financial platforms, expand telecoms and digital networks through advanced data analytics, enable digital services in government, and unlock growth in consumer sectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Certified as a&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Great Place to Work &lt;/em&gt;around the world, Baringa has been recognised by the &lt;em&gt;Financial Times &lt;/em&gt;in 22 categories of its UK Leading Management Consultants rankings, and by &lt;em&gt;Forbes &lt;/em&gt;for four consecutive years as one of the World’s Best Management Consulting Firms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our Consumer Products &amp;amp; Retail practice are looking for an experienced Consultant or Senior Consultant to join the team.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW254221914 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW254221914 BCX8&quot;&gt;We are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW254221914 BCX8&quot;&gt;seeking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW254221914 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;a highly motivated and experienced&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW254221914 BCX8&quot;&gt;Senior Consultant to join our consulting team, within the Consumer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW254221914 BCX8&quot;&gt;Products &amp;amp; Retail&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW254221914 BCX8&quot;&gt;industry. This role will focus on helping clients drive competitive advantage through innovative strategies and data-driven decision-making. The ideal candidate will bring a combination of strategic, business, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW254221914 BCX8&quot;&gt;analytical&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW254221914 BCX8&quot;&gt;expertise&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW254221914 BCX8&quot;&gt;, with a strong&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW254221914 BCX8&quot;&gt;consulting background&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW254221914 BCX8&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW254221914 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW254221914 BCX8&quot;&gt;   &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What you will be doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW67067962 BCX8&quot;&gt;You will be working with some of the industry’s leading Consumer Products Brands, from the large established players to the rapidly growing industry disruptors. We provide advisory services to our clients across the entire value chain from concept to shopping&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW67067962 BCX8&quot;&gt;basket&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW67067962 BCX8&quot;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
