&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;About Baringa&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Baringa is a global consulting firm that partners with leaders to drive change and create value. With deep industry expertise, and enabled by advanced technology, the firm helps clients to deliver with greater confidence and certainty. With over 2,000 people across the UK, Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, the firm combines global insight with local understanding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The firm works across energy and resources, financial services, government and public sector, consumer products and retail, pharmaceuticals and life sciences, manufacturing, and technology, media and telecoms, with capabilities spanning strategy, transformation and operational excellence – all powered by advanced technology, data, AI and digital innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clients value Baringa’s collaborative approach and the way its teams integrate seamlessly – all working with a shared understanding of what matters most. The firm is known for its kind, curious experts who listen closely and care deeply about client success as they help clients transform energy markets, modernise financial platforms, expand telecoms and digital networks through advanced data analytics, enable digital services in government, and unlock growth in consumer sectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Certified as a&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Great Place to Work &lt;/em&gt;around the world, Baringa has been recognised by the &lt;em&gt;Financial Times &lt;/em&gt;in 22 categories of its UK Leading Management Consultants rankings, and by &lt;em&gt;Forbes &lt;/em&gt;for four consecutive years as one of the World’s Best Management Consulting Firms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our Markets and Transactions practice are looking for an experienced Senior Consultant to join the team.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be joining our dynamic and growing Advisory practice. We work with a range of clients from across the energy value chain, covering generators and developers, integrated energy companies, policy makers, institutional investors and lenders, to help them successfully navigate the energy transition.&amp;nbsp;Baringa is differentiated through its ability to leverage a fundamental understanding of the market, technical, commercial and regulatory drivers of value and risk to help clients develop projects, deploy capital, or launch new products and services that help decarbonise our economy. This is an opportunity to build out our transactions and strategy offering in biomethane and bioenergy while advising leading energy companies, developers, infrastructure owners, investors and lenders. You will lead high-impact client work, shape our insights and play a leading role in scaling the proposition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What you will be doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead strategy advisory:&lt;/strong&gt; Leveraging our industry-trusted bioenergy market insights and proprietary analysis, take day-to-day ownership of engagements spanning investment strategy, market entry, commercial structuring, and regulatory reviews across biomethane, waste-to-energy and wider bioenergy vectors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support transactions:&lt;/strong&gt; Run buy side and sell side commercial due diligence, vendor commercial due diligence and bid support, working closely with corporate, infrastructure and private equity clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop our bioenergy offering:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the continued growth of our advisory in biomethane, waste-to-energy, and related bioenergy vectors, collaborating across modelling capabilities and commercial, technical, and regulatory advisory teams to bring the best of Baringa.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop the team:&lt;/strong&gt; Coach and develop junior colleagues, fostering a culture of collaboration, support, high performance and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop and manage client relationships:&lt;/strong&gt; Help manage and deepen existing client relationships while building new ones, and deliver high-impact strategic and commercial propositions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support business development:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to proposals, brand building and origination of new opportunities in the biomethane and wider bioenergy sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver high-quality engagements:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure excellence in project delivery and client management, including quality assurance, financial management and commercial oversight.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Your skills and experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional experience:&lt;/strong&gt; approximately 5+ years of professional experience in the energy sector, ideally with emphasis on bioenergy, gained as a strategy consultant or M&amp;amp;A advisor, in corporate development or M&amp;amp;A within an energy company, or as a principal investor in a private equity or infrastructure fund.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy and transactions:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience supporting growth strategy, market entry, technical and/or commercial due diligence and other transaction-related engagements within bioenergy or related sectors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bioenergy sector understanding:&lt;/strong&gt; A fundamental understanding of bioenergy markets, with preference for depth on biomethane and a working knowledge of waste-to-energy and other bioenergy vectors, including demand drivers, feedstock dynamics and regulation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial and regulatory acumen: &lt;/strong&gt;Familiarity with commercial structuring (e.g. offtake and feedstock supply agreements) and the regulatory/subsidy frameworks relevant to biomethane and bioenergy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project leadership:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong analytical skills with the capability to develop hypotheses and draw conclusions within tight timeframes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client relationship management: &lt;/strong&gt;Ability to build trusted client relationships, operate effectively in client-facing environments and engage confidently with senior stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
