&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive measurable improvements in data accuracy, pipeline reliability, and system performance in a high-impact, compliance-critical environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re excited about you because…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have 3 - 4+ years of experience in software or data engineering, with a strong track record of owning and delivering complex backend or data infrastructure projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have deep expertise in distributed systems and data engineering, with hands-on experience in tools like Snowflake, dbt, Fivetran, or similar modern data stack technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
