&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;0-1 Ownership: &lt;/strong&gt;Proven experience taking at least one product from 0-1, across a new product, market or startup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Craft Mastery: &lt;/strong&gt;A portfolio of high-fidelity, shipped work that moved measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Thinking: &lt;/strong&gt;You balance customer needs, business goals and feasibility, and frame ambiguous problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bias for Action: &lt;/strong&gt;You’d rather ship and learn than polish in isolation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems and AI Fluency: &lt;/strong&gt;You design reusable systems, prototype with AI and coach peers to do the same.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Influence: &lt;/strong&gt;You mentor designers and win over partners with differing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
