&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Insight Enterprises, Inc. is a Fortune 500 Solutions Integrator helping organizations accelerate transformation by unlocking the power of people and technology. We architect, build and manage solutions for complex IT environments to deliver outcomes that contribute to our clients&#39; success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our portfolio of digital transformation services includes deep expertise in cloud, data, AI, cybersecurity and intelligent edge. These services, augmented by Insight&#39;s longstanding relationships with 6,000+ technology partners across the globe, enable us to deliver the right technical solutions quickly and effectively. We&#39;re rated as a Great Place to Work, a Forbes Best Employer for Diversity and a Forbes World&#39;s Top Female-Friendly Company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WE ARE AMDARIS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Amdaris, we bring together exceptional talent to deliver custom software solutions and drive digital transformation. Our acquisition by Insight last year has only solidified our standing in the market to become the leading provider of software solutions and paving the way for an exciting growth trajectory with ambitious future goals in AI Consulting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our expertise spans software development, cloud computing, IT strategy, and digital innovation, helping businesses optimise their technology and achieve their strategic objectives. With cutting-edge projects and a dynamic team, there has never been a better time to join us and be part of our journey to shape the future of technology.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will lead the review of client applications and their technology and product strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will monitor emerging technologies, including AI, GenAI and machine learning trends, assessing their relevance and potential application within client solutions and strategies, and provide recommendations on adoption and integration opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will produce detailed reports providing guidance on enhancements, best practice, and risk mitigation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working directly with clients, you will interact with senior stakeholders to understand the business objectives and strategy; uncover and challenge technical requirements, technology approaches, methodology, security and tech stack decisions in line with business goals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will review and interpret architectural approach, infrastructure and data flows; assessing advising on best practice SDLC methodology and ways of working.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigation will include the review of architecture diagrams and technical documentation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will maintain effective internal relationships with sales, technical, product and delivery colleagues.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be confident in providing technical support during sales pitches and proposals and will help to identify and promote additional value add services.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SOLUTIONS ARCHITECT (APPS &amp;amp; AI) REQUIREMENTS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in software, application, and/or enterprise architecture methods and approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining and improving architectures, and linking decisions to business objectives and technology strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on delivery of GenAI solutions (LLMs, prompt engineering, AI features).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building, deploying, and operating cloud solutions, including the operational impact of design choices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to review client applications, architecture, documentation, data flows, technology stacks, and SDLC/Agile practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on credibility across languages, APIs, data stores, and integration patterns sufficient to challenge technical decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to identify and mitigate security, privacy, data, operational, and AI-specific risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience engaging senior clients, challenging assumptions, and influencing technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to produce decision-ready architecture reports covering findings, risks, and recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting pitches and proposals, shaping credible solutions, and identifying additional client value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
